# 2026-09-02 22:58:13.102868
+Front Desk Case 1 hangs on Starting analysis after I want to loose weight.
+Cause: callReceptionistAgent JSON.parse fails at call_agent.ts:322 because gemini-3.5-flash-lite emits runaway decimals like weightKg: 74.0000... (tens of thousands of zeros). Generate takes ~2 min. Fallback runs but the UI still looks stalled.
+Fix ONLY src/server/receptionist/call_agent.ts:
+1. Before JSON.parse, sanitize numeric literals (cap decimal/integer length) so parse cannot explode.
+2. Never console.error the full raw JSON dump.
+3. Set maxOutputTokens so a runaway number cannot stream for minutes.
+4. On parse fail, return needs_info quickly with a useful userResponse (weight-loss onboarding), not a generic hello, so the job completes and the client leaves Starting analysis.
+Do not edit other files. Do not git commit.

